.TH PANORA-GUI 1 "2026-09-19" "panora" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
panora-gui, panora \- Panora clipboard history popup
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B panora
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.br
.B panora-gui
.RB [ \-\-gapplication\-service ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B panora-gui
is the GTK4/libadwaita panel that shows the clipboard history recorded by
.BR panod (1):
search as you type, filter by type (text, link, image, file, rich text,
colour, pinned), pin, delete, inspect an entry and put it back on the
clipboard. It is a single-instance application: launching it while the panel
is open closes the panel, which is what Super+V, the launcher entry and
.B panora-cli toggle
rely on.
.SH KEYBOARD
.TP
.B Ctrl+F
Focus the search box.
.TP
.B Up, Down, Left, Right, Home, End, Page Up, Page Down
Move between entries.
.TP
.B Enter
Put the selected entry on the clipboard (and paste it when instant paste is
enabled), then close.
.TP
.B Shift+Enter
Put only the plain text of the selected entry on the clipboard.
.TP
.B Ctrl+1 \&... Ctrl+9
Put the Nth entry on the clipboard; the first nine rows show their number.
.TP
.B Space
Open the details view (full text, full-size image, formats).
.TP
.B Ctrl+D
Pin or unpin the selected entry.
.TP
.B Delete
Delete the selected entry; the toast offers an undo for 30 seconds.
.TP
.B Any printable key
Start (or continue) a search from wherever the focus is.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+P
Toggle private mode.
.TP
.B Ctrl+,
Open settings.
.TP
.B Esc
Clear the search; close when the search is empty.
.SH BEHAVIOUR
The panel closes when keyboard focus moves to another window, like the
Windows Win+V flyout; the
.B Close when focus leaves
setting turns that off. Instant paste sends Ctrl+V, or Ctrl+Shift+V when the
focused window is a terminal emulator.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-gapplication\-service
Start as a D-Bus service without showing a window (used by D-Bus activation).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/panora/config.toml
Settings written by the preferences dialog.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR panod (1),
.BR panora-cli (1)
.SH BUGS
https://github.com/ygkali/panora/issues
